; stored values are concrete: the scalar loop computes fp(i) = 10 - 2*i = {10, 8, 6, 4}
; and stores fp(i) to p[(i64)fp(i)], i.e. p[10]=10, p[8]=8, p[6]=6, p[4]=4.

